pt;\"=\"\" style=\"font-family: 돋움, Dotum;\"> </span></b></p></div><h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 20px; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 18px; text-transform: uppercase;\">DESCRIPTION</h2><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 20px; font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">The GL60 Plus DJI Matrice 300 drone spotlight based on DJI Payload SDK, compatible with DJI M300 drone, powered by DJI Skyport V2.0, super brightness up to 13400LM, max lighting area to 1225m², Max power 120W. The aerial illumination effect of drones during night operations has been raised to a whole new level. The overall design is ultra-lightweight, only 750g, the DJI M300 spotlight is widely used for night patrols, surveillance, power line inspection, search and rescue, and other night operations.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 20px; font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Features:</p><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Spotlights develop on DJI SDK Payload, compatible with DJI M300 drone.</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Easy to install and use, just plug and play, mount to the gimbal port, just like you install the H20 camera.</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Follow the gimbal camera (H20/H20T)&nbsp; rotation synchronization.</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">High power up to 120W, super brightness to 13400LM.</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Non-reflective bowl design, reducing effective brightness loss, with strong light flash mode, silently driving away and indicating direction.</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Imaging-grade optical technology, 4 sets of optical lens groups, 1 group of 4 lenses, 15-degree luminous angle.</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\">Compare with GL60 Zoom, it is much better than GL60 Zoom spotlights.</span></li></ul><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 20px; font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\">The spotlights performance:&nbsp; GL60 Plus ＞ GL60 Zoom ＞ GL60.</span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 20px; font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Specs:</p><table class=\"__se_tbl_ext\" border=\"1\" width=\"816\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px; font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; height: 629px;\"><tbody style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><td width=\"195\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px;\">Product Model</td><td colspan=\"6\" width=\"434\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px;\">GL60 Plus Spotlight</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px;\">Powered By</td><td colspan=\"6\" width=\"434\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px;\">DJI Skyport V2.0</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px;\">Weight</td><td colspan=\"6\" width=\"434\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px;\">750g</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px;\">Size</td><td colspan=\"6\" width=\"434\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px;\">126*131*167mm</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px;\">FOV</td><td colspan=\"6\" width=\"434\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px;\">15°</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px;\">Voltage</td><td colspan=\"3\" width=\"218\" style=\"